{"id":3964,"date":"2024-04-09T10:02:05","date_gmt":"2024-04-09T10:02:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/?page_id=3964"},"modified":"2024-10-25T09:19:30","modified_gmt":"2024-10-25T09:19:30","slug":"feedback-2","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/feedback-2\/","title":{"rendered":"FEEDBACK"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"container section-title-container\" ><h1 class=\"section-title section-title-center\"><b><\/b><span class=\"section-title-main\" >FEEDBACK M\u00d3N QU\u00c0 V\u00d4 GI\u00c1 T\u1eea KH\u00c1CH H\u00c0NG C\u1ee6A ANGELINE<\/span><b><\/b><\/h1><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">M\u1ed7i b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c Hoàng Lâm Decor t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u00fd ngh\u0129a. Hoàng Lâm Decor &#8211; Event Planner tin r\u1eb1ng, nh\u1eefng k\u00fd \u1ee9c n\u00e0y c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng l\u1edbn v\u1edbi m\u1ed7i kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. V\u1edbi t\u00e2m huy\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng, \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Hoàng Lâm Decor lu\u00f4n c\u1ed1 g\u1eafng bi\u1ebfn m\u1ed7i &#8220;\u0111\u1ec1 b\u00e0i&#8221; t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o v\u00e0 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">M\u1ed7i l\u1eddi ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng &#8211; d\u00f9 l\u00e0 l\u1eddi khen ng\u1ee3i hay g\u00f3p \u00fd &#8211; \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 qu\u00fd gi\u00e1. Hoàng Lâm Decor coi tr\u1ecdng t\u1eebng l\u1eddi ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i, b\u1edfi ch\u00fang kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap nh\u00ecn nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c m\u00ecnh \u0111ang l\u00e0m m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Hoàng Lâm Decor t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u0111em l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">C\u1ea3m \u01a1n nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Angeline.<\/div>\n\t<div id=\"gap-1096870302\" class=\"gap-element clearfix\" style=\"display:block; height:auto;\">\n\t\t\n<style>\n#gap-1096870302 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-498038003\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-856931771\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1100981497\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"910\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-910x800.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"trang tri sinh nhat cho be angeline\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-910x800.jpg 910w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-455x400.jpg 455w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-768x675.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-1536x1350.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline-600x527.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-cho-be-angeline.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 910px) 100vw, 910px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1100981497 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-9780576\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\"